                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Under 60 is included only on this page, as a point of comparison. Every other page is limited to patients aged 60+.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Median stay is 4 days in every age group, so the average is shown; a few very long stays raise it.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Surgery can only be matched to an admission for patients with one admission, so 'Had surgery' uses those patients. ICU uses admissions with ICU hours recorded (blank = unknown).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Cost is the fee-based estimate from the Cost page (surgery, ICU, medicines; bed-days not costed). With few deaths in each group, read mortality with its confidence interval.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
